                            <comment id="16799818" author="agoncharuk" created="Sat, 23 Mar 2019 22:02:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Similarly to &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11171&quot; title=&quot;Assertion on tx preparing&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-11171&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-11171&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; we need to replace the assertion with &lt;tt&gt;onError(tx.rollbackException());&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
However, it is still not clear why this situation may appear as timeout and prepare stages are properly synchronized. Additional ticket for investigation should be created before this ticket is resolved.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
